    FEAT-0004: apply the facility modernization levy

    Council approved a 2% "facility modernization levy" on every
    registration and price quote, applied after tax, effective this
    quarter (motion 2026-09-14).

    Because REFACTOR-0003 had already pulled the surcharge, concession,
    and tax rates out into named constants next to a single computation,
    the levy slots in the same way: one constant, one multiplication, one
    line on the receipt. Nothing about priceFor's shape needed to change.

    Updates Tests 34-37 for the new totals.

diff --git a/src/invoice.ts b/src/invoice.ts
